data: {"id": "74100be31d0a44ab-thinking-parallel_evidence-791", "run_id": "74100be31d0a44ab", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据工具返回结果，我已确认以下**直接解释 NotReady 的证据链**：\n\n---\n\n### 已确认事实与因果\n\n1. **Readiness Probe 持续失败**\n   - `kubectl_describe` 显示 kubelet 在 23 分钟内不断报错：`Readiness probe failed: Get \"http://172.16.104.16:8080/ready\": dial tcp 172.16.104.16:8080: connect: connection refused`\n   - 近期已转为 HTTP 503 错误（`statuscode: 503`），说明端口 8080 已可连接但应用返回 503。\n\n2. **应用日志确认服务异常**\n   - `kubectl_logs` 显示应用每 2 秒在 `/work` 端点返回 503，错误信息为 `dependency unavailable`。这表明应用本身正在运行，但其依赖（下游服务）不可用，导致健康检查返回 503。\n\n3. **Pod 当前状态**\n   - `kubectl_get_yam", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789088253023, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

